{'symbol': 'SJM', 'date': '2023-01-04 08:30:00', 'title': 'THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. NAMES REBECCA SCHEIDLER SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER OF CONSUMER FOODS', 'text': 'ORRVILLE, OHIO , JAN. 4, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. (NYSE: SJM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ELECTION OF REBECCA SCHEIDLER AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT & GENERAL MANAGER, CONSUMER FOODS, EFFECTIVE JAN. 16, 2023.'}